+        "Vulture-headed scholars and solitary spellworkers. Intelligence and Wisdom are prime requisites. A young Nagpa starts far below 0 XP at −1,100,000 XP, with 2d8, natural AC 7 and one daily use each of Darkness, Paralysis and Create Flames.",
+        "Additional negative-XP tiers grant more Hit Dice and daily uses, unlock Phantasmal Force, and improve the natural AC. The mature tier at 0 XP gives 9d8, natural AC 4 and +2 on saves. Named levels start later, with level 1 at 300,000 XP.",
