+        "A human-headed winged lion. Roll 3d6 for each ability. Limits are Strength and Intelligence 6–18, Wisdom and Constitution 8–18, and Dexterity and Charisma 3–18. Wisdom and Constitution are prime requisites. Strength is relative to similar creatures.",
+        "Start at −3,000,000 XP with 2d8 and AC 5. Table 9 sets attack damage, AC, movement abilities and roar by HD. At 0 XP the normal-monster row is 12d8 and AC 0. Level 1 begins at 300,000 XP and 13d8. Save as a fighter of twice the current HD.",
